  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Creeps and Curses V.3.1</em></p><p><em>Vairocana — Innate Technique (1st level)</em></p><blockquote><p>Harmony and Chaos, the infinite universe that makes up all of creation.</p></blockquote><p>At 1st level, you possess the ability to connect to all things that exist. As an action for 3 cursed energy, you can cast the Locate Creature spell without any components. The range increases to 1 mile at 6th level, 5 miles ft at 11th level and 30 miles at 18th level. As an action for 2 cursed energy, you can cast Speak with Animals or Tongues. At 6th level, you can extend the benefits of Tongues to a number of additional creatures equal to your CE modifier that are within range when you cast it.</p>",
